@node no1 " Introduction"

This is at least the best Duplicate Checker arround at the Moment.
With many good and usefull @{"Features" Link feat}
                                                     @{" Main Menu " Link main}
@endnode
@node no2 " Requirements"

KICKSTART 2.0 or higher
AmiExpress 2.xx - 3.xx

                                                     @{" Main Menu " Link main}

@endnode
@node no3 " Installation "

Copy the FastDupe & FastDupe.Info to your DOORS:
Copy the FileCheck.Info & DUPESTART.INFO to your BBS:/COMMANDS/SYSCMD/
After them open the FastDupe.Info and choose between the available
@{"ToolTypes" Link ToolTypes}

                                                     @{" Main Menu " Link main}
@endnode
@node feat "Notable Features"

Check 3 MB Filelist under 10 secs
Disable specified Users by Name from the Duplicate Check.
or disable with AccessLevel in the FASTDUPE.Info
Display a TXT File after each Duplicate Check.
Executing up to 10 other Doors/Tools after each Upload.
You can make the FASTDUPE Resident for faster Access.

                                                     @{" Main Menu " Link main}

@endnode
